Run a Docker compose file
    docker compose up -d

View Logs of a particular container
    docker compose logs <container-name> --tail=50

Enter Inside a docker container
    docker exec -it $(docker ps -qf "ancestor=confluentinc/cp-kafka:7.5.0") bash

    bash docker exec -it metrics-producer-app sh

Delete and remove everything mapped to docker compose
    docker compose down --volumes --rmi all
